## Modification Notice (GPLv3 §5(a))
**Modern Termux Advanced** (`Furkan00487/modern-termux-advanced`) is a modified
fork of [termux/termux-app](https://github.com/termux/termux-app) and
`Furkan00487/modern-termux` with integrated Termux:X11 support
([termux/termux-x11](https://github.com/termux/termux-x11)).

Because the repository history starts on **2026-10-20** without importing the
full upstream git commit history, this `NOTICE` documents the upstream origin
and modifications:

- **Upstream base:** `termux/termux-app` (`v0.118.0`, `versionCode 118`),
  forked and modified starting **2026-10-20**.
- **Summary of modifications (`2026-10-20` – `2026-11-20`):**
  - `2026-10-20` – `2026-10-28`: compileSdk/targetSdk 36 updates, custom Neon
    Cyan theme, integrated `x11/` display server, dynamic `X_` / `>_` icon,
    `RECORD_AUDIO` / `termux-setup-microphone`, bundled XKB archive, custom
    MOTD, and Turkish localization.
  - `2026-10-31` – `2026-11-15`: X11 `hardwareAcceleration` preference and
    `termux-x11-env` environment wrapper (`v0.122.0`), multi-line paste dialog
    & bracketed paste improvements (`v0.123.0`), and X11 `ScreenSaverSuspend`
    keep-screen-awake support (`v0.124.0`).
  - `2026-11-16` – `2026-11-20`: Upstream `termux-app` & `termux-x11` sync
    (`v0.125.0`, including Sixel/iTerm2 image support, X11 server/cursor surface
    updates, and preserved Mali/AHB GPU copy offload & DRI3 safety).

